      "content": "the \"quiet\" you're talking about sounds almost better than this. everything is just so loud and heavy right now. it feels like i'm just dragging a corpse around. if the person who actually mattered is gone, then what am i even waiting for? it feels like i'm just prolonging something that's already over. isn't it just easier to just... let go of the charade entirely?",
